  "description": {
    "en": "Grapplesnake Tour M8 is an octagonal tour-oriented co-polyester string combining exceptional control, stability, durability and tension maintenance with a relatively soft yet crisp response. Its eight-sided profile enhances ball bite, while the slippery surface and soft edges provide a controlled, responsive feel without the excessive harshness associated with many tournament polyester strings. It is available in 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges in a distinctive olive green color.",

    "zh": "Grapplesnake Tour M8 是一款面向竞技和职业级使用的八边形共聚酯单丝球线，在控制、稳定性、耐久性和保磅能力方面表现突出，同时保持相对柔和但依旧清脆的击球反馈。八边形截面有助于增强咬球与旋转，而较光滑的表面和柔和棱角则让它比许多传统竞技聚酯线更容易驾驭。提供1.25毫米与1.30毫米两种线径，并采用非常具有辨识度的橄榄绿色。"
  },

